# Freedom with Friends — ACNH 1.0.0 shared-owner / visitor permissions
# Build ID: 7FC1BAFF976AECA4
#
# GOAL: while on a host island (local play / Hamachi / ldn_mitm), every client
# treats the local player as island owner/resident for:
#   - Nook Stop / Miles redemption
#   - terraforming / place / dig (where those systems exist)
#   - mailbox access against the HOST island villager mail
#
# NOT IN SCOPE for exefs alone:
#   - spawning permanent visitor houses/plots on the host save
#   - silent auto-join without Orville (see scripts/AutoJoin-HamachiHost.ps1)
#
# STATUS: STUB — do not @enabled guessed offsets (save corruption / desync risk).
# Enable this file (rename off .disabled) only after real 1.0 offsets are filled.
# Every multiplayer client must use the same patch set.

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

# @enabled Force IsIslandOwner / resident true
# <offset> mov w0, #1
# <offset> ret

# @enabled Allow Nook Stop / Miles machine as visitor
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow mailbox open / villager mail on host island
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow host terraform / place while visitors present
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Allow visitor terraform / place / dig
# <offset> nop

# @enabled Relax best-friend tool locks
# <offset> nop
